  "recipe": {
    "positive": "Visual style (follow exactly): Nostalgic archival illustration on warm aged parchment, with visible but restrained paper wear, fine sepia ink contours, muted brown and olive washes and a calm heritage atmosphere. Keep one dominant illustrated scene within a thin irregular ink border and small botanical corner flourishes; the same fine ink and parchment rendering applies to any subject. Any archival or map-like ornament stays abstract and subordinate. Do not insert a compass, direction rose, seal, map label or decorative handwriting unless the current content explicitly requests it. When no text is requested, all margins and ornaments remain entirely wordless, with no caption placeholders, letters, numerals or pseudo-script.",
